`KeychainHelper`. `ShoppingListStore.reconcileSyncedItem` in particular \
contains the whole sync-conflict policy for the offline-first shopping list \
and has zero coverage. Prioritize: (1) ShoppingListStore pure-logic tests with \
an in-memory Core Data stack, (2) RecipeFormView populateForm ↔ \
Create/UpdateRecipeRequest round-trip tests, (3) LoginView URL normalization + \
access-token persistence.",
